# Token of the `demoflow-prod` Cloudflare tunnel — its own tunnel, not
# staging's `demoflow-app`. Zero Trust → Networks → Tunnels → demoflow-prod →
# the token from the install command. Public hostname, set in the dashboard:
#
#   demoflow.luna-realm.com  →  HTTP  proxy:80
#
# The one value a person supplies by hand; keep a copy in
# ~/.demoflow/production/cloudflared.env (mode 600).
TUNNEL_TOKEN=
